{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/6725a2e5f585288a27977dcc8d2e4870.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Greenhearth Necromancer</i> is a cozy, witchy, semi-idle game where life and death are both parts of growth. Raise living and undead plants, brew potions, cast spells, and build a balcony garden that thrives on cycles of care, decay, and resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/4926b2131648dc9447f215ac0d8804d1.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/4926b2131648dc9447f215ac0d8804d1.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/4926b2131648dc9447f215ac0d8804d1.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending farming-sim comfort with idle-game flow, it\u2019s a calming, vibey companion you can leave running in the background or step into to conjure more in-depth play.\u00a0 Steal a moment to balance water and fertilizer, ward off pests, experiment with magic, or explore the narrative at your own pace \u2014 with relaxing bursts of gardening, progression, and community connection woven throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/c3411c5ed3cdef636d048842f565199f.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young socially-anxious necromancer building a thriving garden on the balcony they inherited from their late grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was a green witch with a renowned garden, but you never had the same green thumb. Instead, you found your talents in necromancy, which makes a grim situation a little more hopeful when all her plants wither away. Use your magic to raise undead plants and tend their spectral flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d6a4341cc85f6305b717c718635a5ff2.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d6a4341cc85f6305b717c718635a5ff2.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d6a4341cc85f6305b717c718635a5ff2.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn spells, resurrect plants, and attract ghostly bees to generate mystical honey. Then take your goods to the local market, spend time with your co-op neighbors, and try to balance your social battery as you find your place in the Greenhearth community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get to know your neighbors \u2014 and your grandmother\u2019s familiar spirit, Compostifer \u2014 you\u2019ll uncover a heartfelt narrative about community, grief, early adulthood, and the natural ebb and flow of magic. Delve into the interconnectedness of life and death with writing from the <strong>BAFTA-nominated writer of </strong><strong><i>I Was a Teenage Exocolonist.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/b58da68894e7cb30d0c3c69aaaf26c49.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for your garden</strong> \u2014 nurture living and undead plants to make a balcony oasis uniquely your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast powerful spells </strong>\u2014 resurrect withered plants, speed growth, repel pests, and even alter plant traits with necromantic energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the cycle of life and undeath</strong> \u2014 bring dead plants back to (un)life and discover special traits and yields unlocked through transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d8933d1997daafaaa9f6fca22eccb278.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d8933d1997daafaaa9f6fca22eccb278.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d8933d1997daafaaa9f6fca22eccb278.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redefine failure</strong> \u2014 every shrivelled leaf is just the start of another journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle, stress-free play </strong>\u2014 let the game run while you work or study, and return when you\u2019re ready for meaningful bursts of care.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/6041eca09bbd64de40e19fc7f2485237.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/72f9116c1c3aeb1777c03bd6736cbb71.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/72f9116c1c3aeb1777c03bd6736cbb71.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/72f9116c1c3aeb1777c03bd6736cbb71.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in narrative storylets to discover the lives of your co-op neighbors and find your place in the Greenhearth community. Along the way, piece together your grandmother\u2019s magical research with the help of her quirky familiar spirit, Compostifer, uncovering a heartfelt narrative about connection, grief, and the natural ebb and flow of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/99e227106f15e46d40dcb4811160e871.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/413bfa976ddb513c88f26d98c04314b3.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/413bfa976ddb513c88f26d98c04314b3.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/413bfa976ddb513c88f26d98c04314b3.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four radio stations to set the vibe \u2014 from lofi beats to calm ambience to productivity drum &amp; bass \u2014 or simply enjoy the peaceful sounds of your garden as the wind dances through the leaves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2127570?t=1758907210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/b0fb349240cac6e9eb9c3ce3b32b51d35cb7cba4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758907210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/83a69ea9067e1c97df1001bec18a7badb3809c92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758907210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/83a69ea9067e1c97df1001bec18a7badb3809c92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758907210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/6725a2e5f585288a27977dcc8d2e4870.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Greenhearth Necromancer</i> is a cozy, witchy, semi-idle game where life and death are both parts of growth. Raise living and undead plants, brew potions, cast spells, and build a balcony garden that thrives on cycles of care, decay, and resurrection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/4926b2131648dc9447f215ac0d8804d1.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/4926b2131648dc9447f215ac0d8804d1.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/4926b2131648dc9447f215ac0d8804d1.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending farming-sim comfort with idle-game flow, it\u2019s a calming, vibey companion you can leave running in the background or step into to conjure more in-depth play.\u00a0 Steal a moment to balance water and fertilizer, ward off pests, experiment with magic, or explore the narrative at your own pace \u2014 with relaxing bursts of gardening, progression, and community connection woven throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/c3411c5ed3cdef636d048842f565199f.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young socially-anxious necromancer building a thriving garden on the balcony they inherited from their late grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was a green witch with a renowned garden, but you never had the same green thumb. Instead, you found your talents in necromancy, which makes a grim situation a little more hopeful when all her plants wither away. Use your magic to raise undead plants and tend their spectral flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d6a4341cc85f6305b717c718635a5ff2.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d6a4341cc85f6305b717c718635a5ff2.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"vid