ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d8933d1997daafaaa9f6fca22eccb278.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d8933d1997daafaaa9f6fca22eccb278.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/d8933d1997daafaaa9f6fca22eccb278.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redefine failure</strong> \u2014 every shrivelled leaf is just the start of another journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle, stress-free play </strong>\u2014 let the game run while you work or study, and return when you\u2019re ready for meaningful bursts of care.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/6041eca09bbd64de40e19fc7f2485237.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/72f9116c1c3aeb1777c03bd6736cbb71.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/72f9116c1c3aeb1777c03bd6736cbb71.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/72f9116c1c3aeb1777c03bd6736cbb71.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in narrative storylets to discover the lives of your co-op neighbors and find your place in the Greenhearth community. Along the way, piece together your grandmother\u2019s magical research with the help of her quirky familiar spirit, Compostifer, uncovering a heartfelt narrative about connection, grief, and the natural ebb and flow of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/99e227106f15e46d40dcb4811160e871.avif?t=1758907210\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/413bfa976ddb513c88f26d98c04314b3.poster.avif?t=1758907210\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/413bfa976ddb513c88f26d98c04314b3.webm?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/extras/413bfa976ddb513c88f26d98c04314b3.mp4?t=1758907210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four radio stations to set the vibe \u2014 from lofi beats to calm ambience to productivity drum &amp; bass \u2014 or simply enjoy the peaceful sounds of your garden as the wind dances through the leaves.</p>","developers":["Silverstring Media Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127570/b41cb9b2e0b8e5911ceb4027d14a6766458b6298/header.jpg?t=1758907210","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Silverstring Media Inc. & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2127570/270925942/9787d193cb41266e49f1543d6e40e860ef60705c/1758828383/dash_